        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-023250",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The data we collect, use, receive, and otherwise process is integral to our business, enabling us to provide our offerings to our customers and providing us with insights to improve our platform and offerings, particularly related to our AI offerings enabled by Navan Cognition.",
        "start_character": 55455,
        "end_character": 55733
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-023250",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-023250-688164a6f9478ec8",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-023250",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These customers are oftentimes smaller and find Navan in various ways, including through our growth marketing efforts and are attracted to the streamlined experience we provide to travelers and the tangible cost savings potential provided by our platform, as well as the convenience of our self-service capabilities.",
        "start_character": 38579,
        "end_character": 38895
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-023250",
